# P13 batch 5
msgctxt "bark 056F:00AB"
msgid "Who are you? "
msgstr "你是誰？"

# P13 batch 5
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I am {name}."
msgstr "我是{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "It is of little import. "
msgstr "那不重要。"

# P13 batch 5
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "It is my business, not yours. "
msgstr "那是我的事，不是你的事。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "bark 056F:01E9"
msgid "I don't care what your name is. I want to know who you are that you feel free to enter into the Sorcerer's Enclave without -my- permission. "
msgstr "我不在乎你叫什麼名字。我想知道你是什麼人，竟敢未經「我」的許可就擅闖巫師聚落。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What do you want from me? "
msgstr "你想從我這裡得到什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I merely seek knowledge. "
msgstr "我只是在尋求知識。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I am a great hero! "
msgstr "我是個偉大的英雄！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I go where I will. "
msgstr "我想去哪就去哪。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Why do I need -your- permission? "
msgstr "我為什麼需要「你的」許可？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Some call me the Avatar. "
#. answer compared by the conversation code
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Some call me the Avatar. "
msgstr "有人叫我聖者。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Some call me the Avatar. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0343"
msgid "Avatar? Strange title. Now, what I want to know is why you feel free to enter into the Sorcerer's Enclave without -my- permission. "
msgstr "聖者？奇怪的稱號。好了，我想知道的是，你為什麼敢未經「我」的許可就擅闖巫師聚落。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "It is of little import. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0460"
msgid "That's as it may be, but I will know who you are if you wish to remain here. "
msgstr "或許吧，但你要是想留在這裡，我就得知道你是誰。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "It is my business, not yours. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0536"
msgid "Is that so? You try my patience, and I have no patience. Begone fool! "
msgstr "是嗎？你在考驗我的耐性，而我根本沒有耐性。滾吧，蠢貨！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you want from me? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:05B3"
msgid "What I want is an intelligent response, intruder. "
msgstr "我要的是一個有腦子的回答，入侵者。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I merely seek knowledge. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0666"
msgid "We don't give it away at the Enclave. It is earned. Tell me why you are here. "
msgstr "在聚落裡，知識不是白送的，得靠自己掙來。告訴我你為什麼在這裡。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Why do I need -your- permission? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:070C"
msgid "Because I run this place... for all intents and purposes. "
msgstr "因為這地方是我在管……實際上是這樣。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:07D8"
msgid "Ah some Fire in you after all! But in truth, while you are here, you go only where I say. Understood? "
msgstr "啊，你身上終究還是有點火氣！不過說真的，你在這裡的時候，只能去我准許的地方。明白嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0828"
msgid "Good. I'm glad we see eye to eye. "
msgstr "很好。很高興我們看法一致。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I go where I will. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0893"
msgid "I did not misspeak myself. You go where I allow you or you die. It's that simple. "
msgstr "我沒說錯。你只能去我准許的地方，不然就死。就這麼簡單。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0923"
msgid "Maybe where you come from, but here you're nothing unless I say you're something. "
msgstr "在你來的地方也許是，但在這裡，除非我說你是個人物，否則你什麼都不是。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Ah, I see. "
msgstr "啊，我懂了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "No really, I am a great hero. "
msgstr "不，真的，我是個偉大的英雄。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am a great hero! "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "This from one who is nothing. "
msgstr "這話竟出自一個什麼都不是的人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "No really, I am a great hero. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:09E6"
msgid "Yes, yes, yes. I'm sure you are, child. "
msgstr "是是是。我相信你是，孩子。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "This from one who is nothing. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0A8B"
msgid "I have no qualms about killing you, fool. In fact, I might gain pleasure from the exercise. "
msgstr "殺了你我一點都不會內疚，蠢貨。事實上，這活動說不定還能讓我樂一樂。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "This from one who is nothing. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgstr "你以痛苦為樂？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "This from one who is nothing. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgstr "是啊，活動活動對你有好處。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Ah, I see. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0B35"
msgid "Good. I'm glad that you do. "
msgstr "很好。很高興你懂。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0BE3"
msgid "What do you mean by that, knave? I could burn you to ashes, if I had a mind to. "
msgstr "你這話什麼意思，無賴？只要我有心，就能把你燒成灰。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgstr "我是說，也許你該少吃點。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Aye, exercise would do you good. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "If only you had a mind. "
msgstr "只可惜你沒有「心」也沒有腦。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0D13"
msgid "Only that of my enemies. I was merely saying that you should have a care for your own welfare. Insulting your betters can be hazardous to your health. "
msgstr "只以敵人的痛苦為樂。我只是說，你該為自己的安危著想。侮辱比你高明的人，可是有害健康的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I didn't know you cared. "
msgstr "我不知道你這麼關心我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "You take pleasure in pain? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "You think you are my better? "
msgstr "你以為你比我高明？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I didn't know you cared. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0DAC"
msgid "I don't. "
msgstr "我才不關心。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "You think you are my better? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0E4D"
msgid "It is a true fact. You are a stranger, whereas I lead these people... for the most part. "
msgstr "這是事實。你是外地人，而我領導這些人……大致上是這樣。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:0EF9"
msgid "Are you insinuating that my physique is less than ideal? I could break you like a dry twig. "
msgstr "你是在暗示我的體格不夠理想嗎？我能像折斷枯枝一樣折斷你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgstr "什麼體格？我沒看到什麼體格。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I mean, perhaps you should eat less. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Your physique is ideal... for a cow. "
msgstr "你的體格很理想……對一頭母牛來說。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1006"
msgid "You play the fool to make jest at my expense, but be wary. I will not take more of your insolence. "
msgstr "你裝瘋賣傻拿我開玩笑，但給我小心點。我不會再忍受你的無禮。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgstr "我不是無禮，只是誠實。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What physique? I see no physique. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "But I've just begun to be insolent. "
msgstr "可是我才剛開始無禮呢。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Your physique is ideal... for a cow. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:110F"
msgid "I don't know what this -cow- you speak of is, but I mislike your tone. Run along, boy. "
msgstr "我不知道你說的「母牛」是什麼，但我不喜歡你的口氣。滾吧，小子。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "If only you had a mind. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:11A9"
msgid "I am a forgiving man, but you go too far. I will not take more of your isolence. "
msgstr "我是個寬宏大量的人，但你太過分了。我不會再忍受你的無禮。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:129C"
msgid "Honesty can be as deadly as deceit if it is not tempered by wisdom. "
msgstr "不以智慧調和的誠實，跟欺騙一樣致命。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Deceit... a thing you know well? "
msgstr "欺騙……是你很熟悉的東西？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I am not insolent, merely honest. "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgstr "你懂什麼智慧？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "But I've just begun to be insolent. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:13A5"
msgid "Your skull will make a fine flagon when I'm done with you. Prepare to meet the Lord of Flame, infidel! "
msgstr "等我收拾完你，你的頭骨正好拿來當酒壺。準備去見烈焰之主吧，異教徒！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Deceit... a thing you know well? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:146F"
msgid "Know one thing, infidel, I never -- ever break my word. Why should I defend myself before one such as you? Leave me be. "
msgstr "記住一件事，異教徒，我從不——從不食言。我何必在你這種人面前為自己辯護？別來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1513"
msgid "Your tenure on Pagan has ended, dolt! I remand you into the care of the Lord of Flame. "
msgstr "你在佩根的日子到頭了，蠢材！我把你交給烈焰之主照顧。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:155E"
msgid "Answer me, stranger. "
msgstr "回答我，陌生人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:15A5"
msgid "You will answer me or you will leave. "
msgstr "要嘛回答我，要嘛滾。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:15F8"
msgid "I give you one last chance to answer me promptly. "
msgstr "我給你最後一次機會，馬上回答我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:166A"
msgid "I'm not your servant and I refuse to wait upon you! Go now, and do not disturb me again. "
msgstr "我不是你的僕人，我才不等你！現在就走，別再來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:16D3"
msgid "Now then, I am a busy man. What do you want of me? "
msgstr "那麼，我很忙。你找我有什麼事？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1746"
msgid "What do you need, Disciple? "
msgstr "你需要什麼，門徒？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:17CB"
msgid "Well, do you have her Truename? "
msgstr "怎麼樣，你拿到她的真名了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1811"
msgid "Do you know what Bane's Truename is? "
msgstr "你知道貝恩的真名是什麼了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:184B"
msgid "Have you accomplished your task? "
msgstr "你完成任務了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:18A2"
msgid "How can I help you, friend? "
msgstr "有什麼我能幫你的，朋友？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 056F:190F"
msgid "Good tidings,  {name}."
msgstr "你好，{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:190F"
msgid "Good tidings,  my alien friend. "
msgstr "你好，我的異鄉朋友。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1947"
msgid "Greetings, offworlder. "
msgstr "你好，異界人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1980"
msgid "Greetings, Earthling. "
msgstr "你好，地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:19BA"
msgid "Greetings, Britannian. "
msgstr "你好，不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1A2A"
msgid "I have no time for idle conversation. Ask your questions and be done with it. "
msgstr "我沒空閒聊。有問題就問，問完就走。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1A61"
msgid "What do you want now? "
msgstr "你又要做什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1A81"
msgid "What?! "
msgstr "什麼？！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1ACD"
msgid "Well. Are you prepared to undertake my task? "
msgstr "怎麼樣？你準備好接下我的任務了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1B0A"
msgid "Will you undertake my task? "
msgstr "你願意接下我的任務嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1B4C"
msgid "The task awaits. Are you ready to begin? "
msgstr "任務在等著你。你準備好開始了嗎？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1BC0"
msgid "Depart now or face my wrath. I do not take kindly to mischievous interlopers. "
msgstr "現在就走，不然就承受我的怒火。我最討厭搗亂的闖入者。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1C0C"
msgid "Leave this place. You are not needed here. "
msgstr "離開這裡。這裡不需要你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1C55"
msgid "Go now, for we have nothing further to discuss. "
msgstr "現在就走吧，我們沒什麼好談的了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1CD6"
msgid "You have earned my wrath. I hold back your destruction now only by sheer force of will. "
msgstr "你已經惹怒我了。我現在全憑意志力，才忍住沒毀了你。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1D1E"
msgid "You tempt your fate by remaining here. "
msgstr "你留在這裡是在拿你的命開玩笑。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1D92"
msgid "I find you unfit to walk upon this Enclave's soil. Leave now and your life will be spared. "
msgstr "我認為你不配踏上這座聚落的土地。現在離開，就饒你一命。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1E31"
msgid "The foolish are said to die young. I don't expect you'll see your elder years. "
msgstr "俗話說，愚者早死。我看你是活不到老了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1E7D"
msgid "Do not disturb me or my Sorcerers further. "
msgstr "別再打擾我和我的巫師們。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1EA3"
msgid "Leave me be. "
msgstr "別來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1F42"
msgid "I have been lenient up until now. If you so much as breathe in my direction... make no mistake... you will regret it. "
msgstr "到目前為止我一直很寬容。你要是敢朝我這邊喘一口氣……別懷疑……你會後悔的。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1FAB"
msgid "If you return, I will become angered. You won't like me when I'm angry. "
msgstr "你要是再回來，我就會生氣。我生氣起來，你可不會喜歡。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:1FDF"
msgid "Go now, and do not return. "
msgstr "現在就走，別再回來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2019"
msgid "Farewell, Disciple. "
msgstr "再會，門徒。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:205E"
msgid "Return when you seek more training. "
msgstr "需要更多訓練時再來吧。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:20AD"
msgid "If I could only remember where I put the brimstone... "
msgstr "要是我能想起我把硫磺放哪就好了……"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:20F6"
msgid "Leave me and accomplish your task. "
msgstr "離開這裡，去完成你的任務。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2144"
msgid "When you have Bane's Truename, return to me. "
msgstr "拿到貝恩的真名後，再回來找我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2189"
msgid "Go now. Do not return without her Truename. "
msgstr "現在就去。沒拿到她的真名就別回來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   offworlder. Earthling. Britannian. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，異界人。地球人。不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   offworlder. Earthling. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，異界人。地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   offworlder. Britannian. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，異界人。不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   offworlder. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，異界人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   Earthling. Britannian. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，地球人。不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   Earthling. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   Britannian. "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2270"
msgid "Keep the Fire burning,   "
msgstr "讓火焰永燃吧，"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
