# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:22BA"
msgid "Disturb the Sorcerers here at your own risk. "
msgstr "打擾這裡的巫師，後果自負。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:22F4"
msgid "Now, what was I doing... "
msgstr "我剛才在做什麼來著……"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2335"
msgid "I must remember to replace the wards... "
msgstr "我得記得更換結界……"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I really must be about my business, Earthling. "
msgstr "我真的得去忙我的事了，地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I really must be about my business, Britannian. "
msgstr "我真的得去忙我的事了，不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
