msgid "I really must be about my business, {name}."
msgstr "我真的得去忙我的事了，{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I really must be about my business, my offworlder friend. "
msgstr "我真的得去忙我的事了，我的異界朋友。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I must return to my work, Earthling. "
msgstr "我得回去工作了，地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I must return to my work, Britannian. "
msgstr "我得回去工作了，不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I must return to my work, {name}."
msgstr "我得回去工作了，{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "I must return to my work, my offworlder friend. "
msgstr "我得回去工作了，我的異界朋友。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "When your thoughts are collected come and speak with me, Earthling. "
msgstr "等你想清楚了，再來找我談，地球人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "When your thoughts are collected come and speak with me, Britannian. "
msgstr "等你想清楚了，再來找我談，不列顛尼亞人。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
#. sentence template: keep the {placeholders}
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "When your thoughts are collected come and speak with me, {name}."
msgstr "等你想清楚了，再來找我談，{name}。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2492"
msgid "When your thoughts are collected come and speak with me, my offworlder friend. "
msgstr "等你想清楚了，再來找我談，我的異界朋友。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:24D8"
msgid "I grow weary of your games. Leave me be. "
msgstr "我受夠你的把戲了。別來煩我。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2539"
msgid "Speak to me only when you have something to say, or not at all. "
msgstr "有話要說再跟我說，沒有就閉嘴。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "bark 056F:258E"
msgid "I cannot abide your ill manners. Or is it perhaps slow wit? "
msgstr "我受不了你的無禮。還是說，你只是腦筋遲鈍？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I must learn to hold my tongue. "
msgstr "我得學會管住自己的嘴。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Forgive me. I have offended you. "
msgstr "原諒我。我冒犯你了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Do not turn away from me, rogue. "
msgstr "別轉身不理我，惡棍。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "You will do as I say, knave! "
msgstr "照我說的做，無賴！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "What do you know of wisdom? "
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "Never mind. "
msgstr "算了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I must learn to hold my tongue. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2711"
msgid "I would have to agree. "
msgstr "這點我不得不同意。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Forgive me. I have offended you. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2814"
msgid "I am not so thin-skinned as to be offended by your remarks, but it shows prudence that you saw them to be offensive and can accept fault for your error. What do you want? "
msgstr "我可沒那麼小心眼，會被你的話冒犯。不過你能看出那些話冒犯人，還能認錯，這表示你還算謹慎。你要做什麼？"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "Do not turn away from me, rogue. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:28CD"
msgid "You will not adress me in such a manner! I am not accustomed to being ordered by inferiors. "
msgstr "不准你用這種口氣跟我說話！我可不習慣被下等人命令。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "You will do as I say, knave! "
msgctxt "bark 056F:29D2"
msgid "By the blood of the Destroyer! I'll have your eyes for a necklace! "
msgstr "以毀滅者之血起誓！我要把你的眼珠子做成項鍊！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "bark 056F:2AC4"
msgid "Something you said was wrong. Giant, blue letters appeared, blazing across the sky. It's a sign from Pyros! "
msgstr "你說的話有個地方不對。巨大的藍色字母出現了，在天空中熊熊燃燒。這是派羅斯的徵兆！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "bark 056F:2B94"
msgid "What is it?! You must hurry. We have no time to waste. I must begin the ritual, now. "
msgstr "是什麼？！你得快點。我們沒時間浪費了。我必須馬上開始儀式。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "bark 056F:2C42"
msgid "There is no time for conversation. You must get her Truename. Only that will allow me to avert the coming disaster, and quite possibly my own death. "
msgstr "沒時間聊天了。你必須拿到她的真名。只有那樣，我才能避免即將到來的災難，還很可能保住我自己的命。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid "I don't know it yet. "
msgstr "我還不知道。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid " Sabriane."
msgstr "莎布莉安。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid " Bane."
msgstr "貝恩。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid " Daemion."
msgstr "戴蒙。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after ""
msgctxt "ask 056F"
msgid " Morduin."
msgstr "莫杜因。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after " Bane."
msgctxt "bark 056F:2D7A"
msgid "That name has no use to me, dolt. I said get her Truename. Go! Do not return without it. "
msgstr "那個名字對我沒用，蠢材。我說了要她的真名。去！沒拿到就別回來。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after " Daemion."
msgctxt "bark 056F:2E1E"
msgid "Fool! That is most definitely not her Truename. And if you don't get it quickly, you'll have no use for yours. "
msgstr "蠢貨！那絕對不是她的真名。要是你不趕快弄到，你自己的真名也用不著了。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after " Morduin."
msgctxt "bark 056F:2EC2"
msgid "How can one be so stupid? Must I be surrounded by incompetents? Get Bane's Truename, or face the consequences. "
msgstr "怎麼有人能這麼蠢？難道我身邊全是些無能的傢伙？去弄到貝恩的真名，不然就等著承擔後果。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I don't know it yet. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2F67"
msgid "Do not waste time with your lies. Get me her Truename or you'll die before she can kill me! "
msgstr "別拿你的謊話浪費時間。去給我弄到她的真名，不然在她殺我之前，你就先死了！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after "I don't know it yet. "
msgctxt "bark 056F:2FEC"
msgid "I have had enough of you, fool! There won't be enough of you left to inter when I'm done with you! "
msgstr "我受夠你了，蠢貨！等我收拾完你，你剩下的東西連埋都不夠埋！"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after " Sabriane."
msgctxt "bark 056F:3085"
msgid "A weak name for a weakling Sorcerer. Watch now what a real Sorcerer can do, my Disciple. "
msgstr "軟弱的巫師配軟弱的名字。看好了，我的門徒，看看真正的巫師能做什麼。"

# P13 batch 5
#. , after " Sabriane."
msgctxt "bark 056F:31A2"
msgid "If you have her Truename and won't reveal it, you are breaching our contract. If you don't know it, you are insolent. In either case, I will not wait upon your leisure. Return only when you can give me Bane's Truename. "
msgstr "如果你拿到了她的真名卻不肯說，那你就是違約。如果你不知道，那你就是無禮。不管哪一種，我都不會等你慢慢來。等你能告訴我貝恩的真名時再回來。"
